{
 "encounter_id": "00613",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning. Ms Anjali Deshmukh, is that correct?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor. Good morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please sit. I have a note from reception about your breasts. Tell me what is happening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing much, actually. Just breast tenderness before my periods. I thought I should mention it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Since when are you having this tenderness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six months now. It is not a big problem."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it come at a particular time of the month?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, the week before my period. Then it goes away once the period starts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That pattern is useful to know. Is anything else also happening in that week?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little bloating. My stomach feels tight. I am also irritable, my husband says."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I see. And what about headaches?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Headaches, yes. But I cannot tell you when they began. Maybe a year, maybe longer. I never wrote it down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That is fine, we will not worry about the exact timing. Any nipple discharge?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No discharge."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any lump that you have felt in either breast?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No lumps. I checked in the bath."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any fever recently?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, your medicines. What are you taking regularly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Every day, twice?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, twice a day. Though some nights I forget the second one. So I am not sure I take it every single day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for being honest. That is important for us. What else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Levothyroxine, in the morning. I think 50 micrograms, maybe? I am not fully sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We will confirm the dose from your records. Anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A vitamin D capsule, 60000 units, once a week on Sundays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, sulpha drugs. My mother told me. I do not remember what reaction happened."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alright. Sulpha drugs, reaction not remembered. I will note it clearly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medical conditions do you have, along with those tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "PCOS, since college. Thyroid problem, hypothyroidism. And sugar, type 2 diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "PCOS, hypothyroidism and type 2 diabetes. Have you had any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix removal, in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any illnesses in your family that I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father has high blood pressure. That is all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what work do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I am a software engineer. Sitting job, mostly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I do not drink alcohol."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your diet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Vegetarian, always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Now, let me take some measurements.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 124 over 80. Pulse 76. Oxygen saturation 99 percent.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it normal?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Quite normal. Your weight is 62 kilos and your height is 160 centimetres. That gives a BMI of 24.2."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How is your breathing generally? Any trouble?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Breathing is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your heart, any chest pain or racing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heart is fine also."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Now I will examine your breasts. Please lie back.",
   "pause": 14
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both breasts look symmetrical. There is mild tenderness on pressing, on both sides.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, that is the tender place."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I am now checking under the arms. The glands there are not enlarged.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That is good, no?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, good. You can sit up now. Let me explain my thinking step by step."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pain before periods is usually related to hormone changes. I cannot rule out fibrocystic breast changes, which are harmless but common."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fibrocystic? Is it cancer?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, it is not a cancer. I only mention the name so you know what we are considering."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I also cannot rule out a thyroid or hormone imbalance contributing, since you have the thyroid condition."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So I would like to order a thyroid function test, and a prolactin level."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Blood test?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, one sample. I will add an HbA1c as well, to check your sugar control."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I will also arrange a breast ultrasound, just to be thorough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When can I do it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The front desk will give you a slot. Please do all tests this week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will go today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. For the tenderness, a well-fitting supportive bra helps, and cutting down caffeine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please come back in three weeks with the reports, and we will decide the next step together."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks, I will book it. Thank you, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You are welcome. Take care of yourself, and do not downplay things next time."
  }
 ],
